                                                                <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-1"><div> - Students are required to complete an internal or external internship for which they are awarded 9 CFU.<br/>Foreign students, who do not hold an Italian high school diploma, an Italian bachelor's degree or a certificate of knowledge at the A2 or higher level per the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages (CEFR), can acquire 3 CFU through the optional "Additional Language Skills: Italian" activity; in that case, they can complete an internship for which they are awarded 6 CFU.</div>
</div>
